SUMMARY:Cardio Workout with Angie in the Rouge!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Meetup Location**: **55 Twy
 n Rivers Dr\, Scarborough\, ON M1B5R9**\nCarpool is suggested as parking i
 s limited.\n\nHike hard and fast in the Rouge!\n\nThis is a hilly\, fast p
 aced and energetic hike recommended for intermediate to advanced hikers. I
 f you are a beginner and or have health conditions this hike is not for yo
 u.\n12km and it will be focused on high cardio. The trails are near Picker
 ing\, Ontario. Generally considered a moderately challenging route\, there
  are several creeks\, rivers\, wetlands and ponds along the way. Lots of d
 iversity\, The southern portion interacts much more with water\, so you ca
 n expect a more forested hike along the northern sections.\nBring 2L of wa
 ter and a snack\,
