SUMMARY:Halloween Dance Party and Scavenger Hunt
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**It's a Halloween Dance Part
 y and Scavenger Hunt!**\n\n**Location: Party Room 51 Trolley Crescent**\n*
 *(Scavenger Hunt is under the bridge)**\n\n**Non-refundable fee:**\n*****$
 20 by October 19th********\n**$25 from October 20th to 28th\n**Send to**\n
 **boots4hikingthesix@gmail.com**\n\n**Party Details**\n***Theme**: Unmask 
 your hidden self.*\n*** Vibe*: Grown-up drinks\, killer costumes\, and zer
 o filters.\n\n**Drop the mask and let your true monster out to play this H
 alloween.**\nPrize for best costume!\nEvery day we wear the mask of the pr
 ofessional\, the polite\, and the responsible. Not tonight. This Halloween
 \, it’s time to shed your civilized skin and unleash your **real persona
 lity**—no filters\, no judgements\, just pure\, unadulterated fun.\nCome
  as who you *actually* are on the inside.\n🖤 The Ritual\n\n*** Date: **
 Saturday\, October 31st\, 2026\n*** Time: **7:00 PM until the spirits fade
 **\n*** Lair: We are just confirming the venue. We will keep you posted!\n
 \n🍷 The Elements\n\n*** Potions & Brews: **Drinks and nibbles provided!
 \n*** Attire: **Costumes required. Dress as your inner alter-ego\, your de
 epest obsession\, or the version of you that only comes out after dark.\n*
 ** The Vibe: **Dark beats\, heavy pours\, and wicked company.\nADMISSION I
 S $20\,\n\nAre you brave enough to show your true colours?
